  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rwx9NKR/image.png\" alt=\"CraftKaijuLogo\" width=\"1023\" height=\"158\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>基於《哥吉拉大戰金剛》怪獸宇宙的 Minecraft 模組</strong><br>每個加入模組的怪獸都配有專屬武器掉落物、絨毛玩偶、石碑與洞穴壁畫<br>目前模組中僅有冰霜巨獸「志摩」，後續將持續新增更多怪獸<br><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1245270933787119637/1281204243214372924/CraftKaijuShimoThumnail.png?ex=6758c52f&amp;is=675773af&amp;hm=333ec999f75c8f321058d4e7b34d9f71d03266b582e6fdf60679e8d979447b66&amp;=&amp;format=webp&amp;quality=lossless&amp;width=1202&amp;height=676\" alt=\"\" width=\"561\" height=\"316\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe style=\"width:384px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CHvoWECcTnE\" width=\"384\" height=\"222\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:380px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/V8IpgHRg0Gg\" width=\"380\" height=\"223\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">模組需搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pehkui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pehkui</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib</a></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a> 為選用模組</span><br><br>MCreator→</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://mcreator.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mcreator.net/</a><strong><br>允許未經授權使用紋理與模型。</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tCTHtVh/image.png\" alt=\"Discord Link\" width=\"129\" height=\"30\"></strong> &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><a 